# Example demo videos — too large for a normal git push (GitHub hard-blocks files over
# 100MB); hosted as assets on the GitHub release instead and linked from README.md. The
# example screenshots (small PNGs) are still checked in normally.
examples/*.mov

# Ad-hoc local manual-testing scratch space (screen recordings, raw captures, scratch
